WEBVTT

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:05.330
You want me to go home?

00:00:05.570 --> 00:00:06.020
Yes.

00:00:06.730 --> 00:00:09.060
We don't know how strong Vintage is.

00:00:09.060 --> 00:00:12.150
If we're in one place, we risk 
being crippled by one attack.

00:00:12.770 --> 00:00:14.750
Have Tsukiyo go about her life normally.

00:00:14.750 --> 00:00:17.560
But you must not reveal yourself, Vulcanus.

00:00:17.560 --> 00:00:21.250
On your left wrist is a tag 
made from Haqua's raiment.

00:00:21.250 --> 00:00:22.630
If anything happens, tear it off.

00:00:23.270 --> 00:00:25.010
I'll know something is wrong at once.

00:00:25.980 --> 00:00:27.780
What are you going to do?

00:00:27.780 --> 00:00:29.810
Search for the remaining goddesses.

00:00:30.350 --> 00:00:32.260
I apologize for burdening you with this task.

00:00:32.870 --> 00:00:34.300
By the way, Katsuragi...

00:00:34.910 --> 00:00:39.650
You're not going to tell me that 
the other girls hosting my sisters

00:00:40.510 --> 00:00:42.430
are all your girlfriends, are you?

00:00:42.900 --> 00:00:44.020
Can't say...

00:00:44.020 --> 00:00:46.190
I haven't found the other goddesses yet.

00:00:51.780 --> 00:00:53.690
It boggles my mind...

00:00:53.990 --> 00:00:59.600
Why is Tsukiyo attracted to this dirty, 
disgusting, unknown quantity of a man?

00:00:59.600 --> 00:01:01.240
Everyone's a hater!

00:01:01.660 --> 00:01:03.180
Tsukiyo loves you.

00:01:03.590 --> 00:01:04.370
Understood?

00:01:08.000 --> 00:01:10.290
R-Release me!

00:01:11.430 --> 00:01:12.370
Tsukiyo...

00:01:14.040 --> 00:01:15.090
Be careful.

00:01:16.750 --> 00:01:19.090
You should be careful, as well, Keima.

00:01:20.750 --> 00:01:21.690
Yeah.

00:01:24.270 --> 00:01:26.360
<i>Three more to go.</i>

00:03:00.280 --> 00:03:03.080
At least the goddess search isn't as urgent now.

00:03:00.430 --> 00:03:04.740
<b>Punch and Date</b>

00:03:03.080 --> 00:03:03.960
Why not?

00:03:03.960 --> 00:03:04.740
Well...

00:03:05.080 --> 00:03:09.620
With the curse on Kanon gone, 
you can slow down...

00:03:09.620 --> 00:03:10.500
No.

00:03:11.050 --> 00:03:14.960
There's at least one conquest 
I need to complete right away.

00:03:16.630 --> 00:03:18.300
Hello, Katsuragi.

00:03:18.880 --> 00:03:20.050
Isn't it a lovely day?

00:03:24.990 --> 00:03:26.120
Yui...

00:03:26.120 --> 00:03:27.680
Shall we go out together?

00:03:28.340 --> 00:03:29.310
<i>For the moment...</i>

00:03:31.110 --> 00:03:32.270
<i>I should...</i>

00:03:32.940 --> 00:03:34.540
You shouldn't come to my house...

00:03:35.900 --> 00:03:38.440
I don't like people who are too pushy.

00:03:42.710 --> 00:03:44.410
Hey! What was that for?

00:03:44.770 --> 00:03:46.130
Quiet.

00:03:46.130 --> 00:03:48.320
The conquest has already begun.

00:03:50.580 --> 00:03:51.290
Right now,

00:03:51.590 --> 00:03:54.000
I need to conquer Yui.

00:03:54.000 --> 00:03:54.790
Why?

00:03:55.250 --> 00:03:57.420
Currently, Yui isn't herself.

00:03:57.420 --> 00:04:00.130
She may be switched with her goddess.

00:04:00.130 --> 00:04:01.300
You mean...

00:04:01.550 --> 00:04:02.520
Yes.

00:04:03.300 --> 00:04:06.050
It's similar to how Diana 
and Tenri switch places.

00:04:06.830 --> 00:04:08.060
Originally, Yui was

00:04:08.540 --> 00:04:11.280
a rich, obedient girl, who did 
everything her parents said.

00:04:11.660 --> 00:04:13.850
But then, she changed drastically.

00:04:14.470 --> 00:04:15.850
It's entirely possible.

00:04:16.780 --> 00:04:20.110
If the goddess in Yui is currently in control...

00:04:21.600 --> 00:04:23.990
Vintage could discover her!

00:04:23.990 --> 00:04:26.850
Correct, we should move fast...

00:04:27.640 --> 00:04:28.490
However,

00:04:28.810 --> 00:04:30.980
isn't Yui your bane?

00:04:30.980 --> 00:04:33.050
You got that right...

00:04:33.050 --> 00:04:35.570
She came to my house on her own.

00:04:35.570 --> 00:04:37.750
She behaves like a player character.

00:04:37.750 --> 00:04:41.030
Conquering her right away won't be easy...

00:04:41.030 --> 00:04:42.510
You're the one who said you had to.

00:04:43.910 --> 00:04:46.110
We need a major event.

00:04:46.620 --> 00:04:48.530
One that Yui won't be expecting.

00:04:51.330 --> 00:04:54.560
<b>Goddess Search, Day 5</b>

00:04:54.790 --> 00:04:57.520
Sucks that we have gym in the morning.

00:04:57.520 --> 00:04:58.810
So, Yui...

00:04:59.250 --> 00:05:01.330
I see you're still on the girls' team for gym.

00:05:01.330 --> 00:05:04.570
I already told you I never became a boy!

00:05:04.570 --> 00:05:06.830
But you wear a boy's P.E. uniform anyway.

00:05:06.830 --> 00:05:08.200
I'm a girl—

00:05:08.200 --> 00:05:09.820
It really doesn't make a difference.

00:05:12.740 --> 00:05:14.890
That's mean!

00:05:15.540 --> 00:05:18.690
Oh, what time should we practice today?

00:05:18.690 --> 00:05:19.930
Let's see...

00:05:19.150 --> 00:05:20.790
The Mai School Festival's coming up.

00:05:24.490 --> 00:05:25.970
Huh? Yui?

00:05:28.890 --> 00:05:29.890
Hey, excuse me!

00:05:44.600 --> 00:05:45.650
Wait!

00:05:47.620 --> 00:05:49.090
Ow...

00:05:51.300 --> 00:05:54.020
K-Katsuragi!

00:05:55.070 --> 00:05:57.370
Wh-What are you doing?

00:05:57.370 --> 00:05:59.120
U-Uh, this is...

00:06:01.340 --> 00:06:04.550
I-I've been feeling strange.

00:06:05.290 --> 00:06:07.050
My heart feels confused...

00:06:07.330 --> 00:06:10.680
I know this can't be right...

00:06:12.990 --> 00:06:14.950
You're so cute!

00:06:14.950 --> 00:06:17.360
Now we match perfectly.

00:06:17.360 --> 00:06:18.710
What are you talking about?

00:06:18.710 --> 00:06:20.150
This is wrong...

00:06:20.850 --> 00:06:23.520
I felt my heart skip.

00:06:23.520 --> 00:06:26.600
You're really cute, so you should 
make this your permanent look.

00:06:30.150 --> 00:06:32.920
You got her attention fast.

00:06:32.920 --> 00:06:34.870
Yui is a strong player.

00:06:35.310 --> 00:06:38.870
If I assume the player's role, 
we'll never get anywhere.

00:06:39.620 --> 00:06:41.640
Where did you go, Yui?

00:06:41.640 --> 00:06:42.500
Nowhere.

00:06:43.320 --> 00:06:45.030
Why are you grinning?

00:06:44.090 --> 00:06:46.880
My goal is to reach the ending 
as soon as possible.

00:06:45.030 --> 00:06:46.880
What? No reason.

00:06:46.880 --> 00:06:48.680
If I play the heroine,

00:06:48.680 --> 00:06:51.060
allowing Yui to conquer me, 
I'll get the same result.

00:06:51.540 --> 00:06:54.400
I have data from tens of thousands of heroines.

00:06:54.400 --> 00:06:56.390
I will use that data as Yui conquers me.

00:06:56.930 --> 00:06:59.660
I shall become the Conquered God!

00:07:00.120 --> 00:07:02.650
Will this really work?

00:07:04.030 --> 00:07:06.210
M-My Exalted Brother?

00:07:06.210 --> 00:07:07.170
Yep.

00:07:07.170 --> 00:07:09.400
I think he went somewhere...

00:07:09.910 --> 00:07:10.940
Oh.

00:07:12.420 --> 00:07:14.370
<i>Where'd he go?</i>

00:07:20.400 --> 00:07:21.370
Katsuragi!

00:07:21.810 --> 00:07:23.320
You're so cute...

00:07:23.320 --> 00:07:24.880
U-Um...

00:07:25.580 --> 00:07:28.380
I have a question for you.

00:07:28.380 --> 00:07:31.380
<b>Faculty</b>

00:07:30.940 --> 00:07:35.340
It can be awkward when I want to use 
the restroom, so I come here...

00:07:35.340 --> 00:07:37.670
Can you stand outside, in case someone comes?

00:07:37.670 --> 00:07:39.000
Sure...

00:07:41.970 --> 00:07:45.320
<i>I don't know how boys go...</i>

00:07:54.250 --> 00:07:55.490
Say, Katsuragi...

00:07:56.110 --> 00:07:58.530
Which kind of underwear are you wearing?

00:07:58.530 --> 00:08:00.150
Men's underwear...

00:08:05.310 --> 00:08:09.880
Katsuragi, in the past, was there 
something between us?

00:08:11.470 --> 00:08:13.630
Maybe... I don't know.

00:08:13.840 --> 00:08:16.140
O-Oh...

00:08:17.440 --> 00:08:18.760
Anyway, Yui...

00:08:19.520 --> 00:08:20.350
Hmm?

00:08:20.760 --> 00:08:23.550
Would you go on a date with 
me today, after school?

00:08:25.090 --> 00:08:27.980
I want to get to know you better...

00:08:28.280 --> 00:08:29.330
Huh?!

00:08:30.010 --> 00:08:31.290
W-Wait...

00:08:31.290 --> 00:08:33.240
Let me think it over!

00:08:34.520 --> 00:08:37.240
Yesterday, she was the one asking me out,

00:08:37.620 --> 00:08:39.260
but when I asked her today, she ran.

00:08:40.310 --> 00:08:41.620
Something has changed.

00:08:41.620 --> 00:08:43.920
What? Explain what you mean.

00:08:43.920 --> 00:08:46.880
That was the real Yui, not the goddess.

00:08:47.130 --> 00:08:49.960
When I first ran into her again, 
she introduced herself to me.

00:08:50.380 --> 00:08:54.010
She didn't remember the conquest, 
but her feelings for me still existed.

00:08:54.880 --> 00:08:57.350
I will give those unconscious feelings a purpose.

00:08:57.810 --> 00:09:01.770
During the conquest, Yui and I switched bodies.

00:09:02.380 --> 00:09:07.260
I'm going to try to invoke her memory 
of the time she spent in my body.

00:09:07.900 --> 00:09:11.150
That may awaken her memory of the conquest.

00:09:11.450 --> 00:09:13.020
Will it actually work?

00:09:13.020 --> 00:09:14.790
She's already shown a response.

00:09:14.790 --> 00:09:18.220
I'm guessing the goddess 
is waking up right now.

00:09:18.730 --> 00:09:21.610
Yui, you are a good player character.

00:09:22.150 --> 00:09:24.910
However, I am a master in this field.

00:09:27.340 --> 00:09:30.120
During our date after school, we will settle this!

00:09:30.120 --> 00:09:31.800
Yui, prepare yourself!

00:09:36.760 --> 00:09:38.740
<b>Faculty</b>

00:09:40.130 --> 00:09:43.520
Katsuragi seemed different today.

00:09:43.970 --> 00:09:45.470
Because he was dressed like a girl?

00:09:46.020 --> 00:09:48.080
He's still the same person on the inside.

00:09:51.560 --> 00:09:53.030
My head

00:09:53.570 --> 00:09:55.410
is spinning...

00:10:02.310 --> 00:10:03.160
What?!

00:10:03.910 --> 00:10:05.730
Who are you?

00:10:06.470 --> 00:10:07.850
Where am I?

00:10:17.910 --> 00:10:19.890
I come from Heaven.

00:10:20.310 --> 00:10:22.910
I am the goddess of war 
who judges the wicked.

00:10:22.910 --> 00:10:24.140
My name is Mars.

00:10:25.420 --> 00:10:27.890
I must be really tired...

00:10:28.370 --> 00:10:30.230
Is this the human world?

00:10:30.230 --> 00:10:31.920
Why have I been awakened?

00:10:32.520 --> 00:10:34.650
Has the seal been broken?

00:10:34.820 --> 00:10:38.670
I don't need this! I've got enough 
on my mind with this date!

00:10:38.670 --> 00:10:39.660
Date?

00:10:39.660 --> 00:10:43.160
<b>From: Keima
Title: To Yui

00:10:40.190 --> 00:10:43.160
I'm meeting Katsuragi at DezeniSea, at 5 PM!

00:10:43.490 --> 00:10:44.640
Dezeni?

00:10:44.640 --> 00:10:45.920
What's that?

00:10:45.920 --> 00:10:47.320
Okay... Let's do this.

00:10:47.320 --> 00:10:48.720
Listen to me!

00:10:49.300 --> 00:10:51.440
I have a bad feeling about this...

00:10:51.440 --> 00:10:53.540
You should carry a weapon on you.

00:10:54.340 --> 00:10:56.570
You're a strange one...

00:10:57.540 --> 00:11:01.300
This world is too relaxed!

00:11:01.770 --> 00:11:05.560
And why are you, a man, 
in love with another man?

00:11:05.560 --> 00:11:07.990
Like I keep saying, I'm a girl!

00:11:07.990 --> 00:11:09.310
That's news to me.

00:11:16.590 --> 00:11:18.440
That should do it.

00:11:18.660 --> 00:11:20.730
How can you stand to dress like that?

00:11:20.730 --> 00:11:22.640
We're battling for control of the relationship.

00:11:22.640 --> 00:11:24.750
I must stay one step ahead of her to—

00:11:24.750 --> 00:11:26.480
Katsuragi!

00:11:29.040 --> 00:11:31.420
Sorry about being late...

00:11:31.660 --> 00:11:33.320
A tuxedo...

00:11:34.750 --> 00:11:37.670
Katsuragi, you look wonderful.

00:11:38.010 --> 00:11:40.370
You're much cuter this way.

00:11:40.370 --> 00:11:42.130
<i>Crap, she's taken the initiative.</i>

00:11:42.130 --> 00:11:44.000
I brought clothes with me.

00:11:44.620 --> 00:11:46.430
Could you put them on?

00:11:50.180 --> 00:11:52.160
Welcome to StarJetter.

00:11:52.160 --> 00:11:53.190
How many are...

00:11:58.010 --> 00:11:59.190
Tickets for two.

00:11:59.190 --> 00:12:01.380
Hey, what's with this dress?

00:12:01.380 --> 00:12:03.040
You're so cute!

00:12:03.040 --> 00:12:04.430
<i>Are they in the parade?</i>

00:12:05.430 --> 00:12:06.950
Please, my lady...

00:12:07.230 --> 00:12:09.090
<i>She's pretending to be a butler?</i>

00:12:09.090 --> 00:12:11.320
<i>I have to applaud her initiative.</i>

00:12:13.270 --> 00:12:17.540
<i>However, Yui's love for me won't 
grow if I let things stand.</i>

00:12:18.250 --> 00:12:20.190
<i>I have to make her fall more deeply for me.</i>

00:12:20.900 --> 00:12:24.240
<i>It's time to awaken the devilish girl inside me!</i>

00:12:29.100 --> 00:12:30.310
A lunch?!

00:12:30.510 --> 00:12:32.360
You made it yourself?

00:12:32.360 --> 00:12:34.930
Yes, I'm a good cook...

00:12:34.930 --> 00:12:36.440
I'm so happy!

00:12:38.010 --> 00:12:39.660
<i>Yui's a rich girl.</i>

00:12:39.660 --> 00:12:42.820
<i>Food that's merely good 
won't make an impression.</i>

00:12:44.150 --> 00:12:46.320
<i>So make everything suck!</i>

00:12:48.680 --> 00:12:51.740
<i>Come on, go crazy for my clumsy self.</i>

00:12:52.730 --> 00:12:54.400
I tried my best...

00:12:54.790 --> 00:12:56.890
H-How is it?

00:12:58.890 --> 00:13:02.640
My mom and dad are so busy,

00:13:02.640 --> 00:13:04.310
I never get a home-cooked meal.

00:13:05.160 --> 00:13:06.970
I'm so happy, I could cry.

00:13:07.810 --> 00:13:09.880
Say, would you cook for me again?

00:13:13.520 --> 00:13:14.800
I'll consider it...

00:13:15.750 --> 00:13:17.770
I'll go buy something to drink!

00:13:19.130 --> 00:13:20.800
Honestly...

00:13:20.800 --> 00:13:23.300
You always fall apart when 
you're on the defensive.

00:13:23.300 --> 00:13:24.700
It's not my fault!

00:13:24.700 --> 00:13:26.820
I'm not used to being conquered.

00:13:27.170 --> 00:13:29.550
You were talking big earlier.

00:13:32.990 --> 00:13:34.540
I'm so happy.

00:13:34.540 --> 00:13:37.380
Katsuragi is opening up to me...

00:13:37.380 --> 00:13:39.330
Was that your beloved?

00:13:40.220 --> 00:13:42.460
She's a lovely girl.

00:13:42.460 --> 00:13:44.200
Again?

00:13:44.200 --> 00:13:46.670
I'll listen to what you have to say later...

00:13:46.670 --> 00:13:48.320
Could you leave me alone for now?

00:13:48.320 --> 00:13:50.470
Besides, Katsuragi is a man!

00:13:50.470 --> 00:13:51.670
What?!

00:13:53.310 --> 00:13:56.760
When was male and female 
clothing reversed on Earth?

00:13:56.760 --> 00:13:58.230
It's a mystery.

00:13:58.810 --> 00:14:01.230
However, I've taken a liking to you.

00:14:02.170 --> 00:14:04.200
You have beautiful eyes

00:14:04.200 --> 00:14:06.240
and a determined spirit.

00:14:06.840 --> 00:14:08.930
I am the goddess of war.

00:14:08.930 --> 00:14:12.090
I shall support you in your battle for love.

00:14:12.090 --> 00:14:13.240
Wh-What?

00:14:14.780 --> 00:14:16.720
Hey, are you alone?

00:14:16.720 --> 00:14:18.520
Wanna have some fun with us?

00:14:18.520 --> 00:14:19.920
You're a real cutie.

00:14:20.200 --> 00:14:21.540
<i>They're trying to pick me up?</i>

00:14:21.540 --> 00:14:22.780
<i>And a banal effort, at that.</i>

00:14:23.930 --> 00:14:26.370
You should rethink your process.

00:14:26.370 --> 00:14:28.720
At least try falling from the sky as an entrance.

00:14:28.720 --> 00:14:31.210
Huh? What are you talking about?

00:14:31.570 --> 00:14:33.230
Are you turning us down?

00:14:33.230 --> 00:14:33.850
Excuse me!

00:14:35.270 --> 00:14:37.850
Don't frighten my beloved.

00:14:37.850 --> 00:14:39.230
Eh?

00:14:39.230 --> 00:14:41.090
What? Are you her boyfriend?

00:14:41.090 --> 00:14:42.230
I am not.

00:14:42.230 --> 00:14:44.070
Then butt out.

00:14:44.070 --> 00:14:46.320
We aren't trying to scare her.

00:14:46.320 --> 00:14:47.600
I am a girl!

00:14:47.600 --> 00:14:48.550
Move!

00:14:52.710 --> 00:14:54.080
Ryo!

00:14:57.330 --> 00:14:59.080
Uh, er...

00:14:59.360 --> 00:15:01.300
Th-Thank you.

00:15:01.620 --> 00:15:02.960
I was so scared...

00:15:06.400 --> 00:15:07.090
Sorry.

00:15:07.650 --> 00:15:09.120
I shouldn't have left you alone.

00:15:11.960 --> 00:15:14.640
I-It's no big deal...

00:15:19.790 --> 00:15:21.480
<i>Why does this keep happening?</i>

00:15:22.170 --> 00:15:25.270
<i>I feel like something's on 
the tip of my tongue...</i>

00:15:25.610 --> 00:15:26.570
What's wrong?

00:15:26.570 --> 00:15:28.990
Oh, it's nothing.

00:15:35.090 --> 00:15:37.910
Demons have taken over the castle!

00:15:37.910 --> 00:15:39.610
Someone help us!

00:15:39.610 --> 00:15:41.500
Restore the peace!

00:15:41.900 --> 00:15:43.280
Welcome!

00:15:43.830 --> 00:15:45.000
Everyone!

00:15:46.900 --> 00:15:49.760
Wow, we can change into costumes...

00:15:49.760 --> 00:15:50.800
This place is great!

00:15:51.980 --> 00:15:56.500
Hmm, I have to say that you 
are a very handsome boy.

00:15:56.500 --> 00:15:58.340
You again?

00:15:58.340 --> 00:16:00.810
It appears that you're doing well with that girl.

00:16:00.810 --> 00:16:02.490
Katsuragi is a boy...

00:16:02.490 --> 00:16:03.690
I'm a girl!

00:16:03.690 --> 00:16:07.590
However, I've never seen such 
a facility used to spread love.

00:16:07.590 --> 00:16:09.840
Even Heaven couldn't top this.

00:16:10.510 --> 00:16:12.030
Haven't you ever been in love?

00:16:13.110 --> 00:16:15.740
Ah, unfortunately, I haven't had the chance.

00:16:15.740 --> 00:16:18.830
I always spent all my time on the battlefield...

00:16:19.140 --> 00:16:20.370
Battlefield?

00:16:20.370 --> 00:16:23.320
Well, it's ancient history now.

00:16:23.320 --> 00:16:25.020
Anyway, I wish you luck.

00:16:25.020 --> 00:16:27.720
You must strike a fatal blow to her heart.

00:16:27.720 --> 00:16:30.010
You're a violent ghost...

00:16:41.750 --> 00:16:43.170
A princess!

00:16:43.170 --> 00:16:44.570
You look so cute!

00:16:44.570 --> 00:16:45.560
Quiet, quiet!

00:16:47.820 --> 00:16:49.860
This place is pretty dark...

00:16:50.570 --> 00:16:51.580
Are you scared?

00:16:52.530 --> 00:16:54.490
Huh? No way.

00:16:54.790 --> 00:16:55.910
Intruders!

00:16:56.970 --> 00:16:58.290
That gave me a start...

00:16:58.290 --> 00:16:59.660
So you are scared.

00:16:59.950 --> 00:17:01.680
I can't help it.

00:17:01.680 --> 00:17:04.770
It wasn't so long ago that 
I was a sheltered girl!

00:17:16.450 --> 00:17:18.220
Lord Amon!

00:17:21.640 --> 00:17:23.270
Congratulations!

00:17:23.270 --> 00:17:25.850
You may now advance to the top floor!

00:17:26.140 --> 00:17:28.860
Oh, that was easier than expected.

00:17:28.860 --> 00:17:30.340
Right, Katsuragi?

00:17:32.260 --> 00:17:33.550
Huh?

00:17:34.640 --> 00:17:36.860
Katsuragi? Where are you?

00:17:37.950 --> 00:17:40.110
Katsuragi!

00:18:03.110 --> 00:18:04.310
Katsuragi!

00:18:06.510 --> 00:18:07.720
Huh?

00:18:07.720 --> 00:18:09.720
What's with this attraction?

00:18:09.720 --> 00:18:11.800
Yui! Be careful!

00:18:11.800 --> 00:18:13.510
This spell is magic from Hell!

00:18:13.510 --> 00:18:14.440
Hell?

00:18:14.670 --> 00:18:17.450
I didn't expect to find a goddess here.

00:18:18.180 --> 00:18:19.880
What are you talking about?

00:18:19.880 --> 00:18:21.640
Where are the others?

00:18:21.640 --> 00:18:23.770
Tell me everything you know.

00:18:23.770 --> 00:18:27.120
If you do, I'll release this girl.

00:18:27.450 --> 00:18:29.260
What are you doing to Katsuragi?!

00:18:29.260 --> 00:18:32.000
Stop! Humans must not be harmed!

00:18:32.000 --> 00:18:33.470
It's too late.

00:18:33.910 --> 00:18:36.260
Very soon, they will all suffer.

00:18:36.540 --> 00:18:37.870
What's going on?

00:18:37.870 --> 00:18:40.140
I thought we sealed away the evil forces!

00:18:40.140 --> 00:18:43.180
Before long, the world will 
be shrouded in darkness...

00:18:43.900 --> 00:18:45.810
As Ancient Hell is restored!

00:18:46.460 --> 00:18:48.810
Stop!

00:18:50.480 --> 00:18:52.770
Get away from Katsuragi!

00:18:53.210 --> 00:18:56.260
A mere human dares to touch me?!

00:19:02.650 --> 00:19:06.620
This is a world of peace, 
in which humans are devoted to love.

00:19:07.340 --> 00:19:09.370
I think it's splendid.

00:19:10.080 --> 00:19:11.380
Do not interfere!

00:19:13.720 --> 00:19:18.130
I, Mars, shall not allow you 
to disrupt my friend's date!

00:19:18.130 --> 00:19:19.090
You...

00:19:28.970 --> 00:19:32.510
Y-Y-You'll pay for this!

00:19:34.060 --> 00:19:36.120
You're really going to pay for this!

00:19:38.920 --> 00:19:40.990
<i>If Yui's goddess is already starting to come out,</i>

00:19:40.990 --> 00:19:42.890
<i>we must provide support.</i>

00:19:42.890 --> 00:19:45.530
<i>We can appeal to both souls by 
creating a scenario that mimics Hell.</i>

00:19:45.890 --> 00:19:49.120
<i>Using a fake crisis is still a bad idea.</i>

00:19:49.120 --> 00:19:51.040
<i>At least it's fake.</i>

00:19:52.130 --> 00:19:54.210
<i>That's much better than a real crisis.</i>

00:19:58.060 --> 00:19:59.200
Still...

00:20:00.330 --> 00:20:01.740
I was hoping you would run away.

00:20:02.780 --> 00:20:06.310
I hate the idea of being saved by a heroine!

00:20:07.840 --> 00:20:09.390
You shouldn't say that.

00:20:09.870 --> 00:20:13.690
Girls are supposed to protect weak boys.

00:20:21.500 --> 00:20:23.160
<i>I really did</i>

00:20:27.530 --> 00:20:29.580
<i>find my prince.</i>

00:20:36.920 --> 00:20:39.090
<b>New Maijima Station</b>

00:20:39.380 --> 00:20:41.490
I'm so happy!

00:20:41.490 --> 00:20:42.760
Hold on...

00:20:43.040 --> 00:20:44.860
The Weiss are loose?

00:20:44.860 --> 00:20:46.040
We must defeat them!

00:20:46.040 --> 00:20:47.270
Cut it out!

00:20:47.270 --> 00:20:49.100
We don't know who's watching...

00:20:50.290 --> 00:20:51.670
This is vexing.

00:20:51.670 --> 00:20:53.210
Must I wait?

00:20:53.870 --> 00:20:55.400
Take this tag.

00:20:56.060 --> 00:20:59.010
If you tear it, I'll receive a message.

00:20:59.010 --> 00:21:02.720
Mars, you aren't as strong as you once were.

00:21:02.720 --> 00:21:04.000
Restrain yourself.

00:21:05.750 --> 00:21:06.840
Got it.

00:21:06.840 --> 00:21:08.280
We'll behave.

00:21:08.730 --> 00:21:09.790
But in return,

00:21:10.150 --> 00:21:13.410
can I call you "Keima"?

00:21:15.270 --> 00:21:17.760
See you at school, Keima!

00:21:21.130 --> 00:21:23.300
Why didn't you tell her about Kanon?

00:21:23.860 --> 00:21:26.620
You mentioned the other goddesses and Vintage.

00:21:26.620 --> 00:21:29.310
Those two are so headstrong, 
they make a fearsome pair.

00:21:29.310 --> 00:21:31.060
We can't have them launching an attack alone.

00:21:31.830 --> 00:21:33.670
Today's attack was staged,

00:21:33.670 --> 00:21:36.340
but we don't know when we'll 
encounter a real threat...

00:21:38.870 --> 00:21:41.190
Katsuragi!

00:21:41.190 --> 00:21:44.640
I've been pickling it for a year, but it's still alive!

00:21:45.710 --> 00:21:46.950
What?

00:21:48.350 --> 00:21:50.580
Exalted Brother!

00:21:52.910 --> 00:21:55.090
My radio show was canceled,

00:21:55.090 --> 00:21:57.330
so I came home to make dinner.

00:21:57.640 --> 00:22:01.480
It's pretty obvious who made what...

00:22:01.480 --> 00:22:03.160
Huh? Really?

00:22:03.160 --> 00:22:06.800
Still, you've already found three goddesses.

00:22:06.800 --> 00:22:08.340
You're so amazing!

00:22:08.620 --> 00:22:10.470
It's because you weren't around.

00:22:10.470 --> 00:22:12.340
Don't say that!

00:22:15.130 --> 00:22:18.440
Exalted Brother, eat some of my cooking!

00:22:18.440 --> 00:22:19.150
I refuse.

00:22:19.500 --> 00:22:20.670
Exalted Brother...

00:22:20.670 --> 00:22:23.070
I haven't been home in a while, 
so you should be nicer!

00:22:23.070 --> 00:22:24.950
It's only been five days.

00:22:24.950 --> 00:22:26.140
Jeez...

00:22:26.140 --> 00:22:29.060
Ah! Haqua, let's take a bath together.

00:22:29.060 --> 00:22:30.370
Eh?

00:24:05.000 --> 00:24:19.860
<b>My Story</b>

00:24:06.170 --> 00:24:07.790
Shiori Shiomiya likes books.

00:24:07.790 --> 00:24:10.170
I've been trying to open her heart 
by encouraging her to write,

00:24:10.170 --> 00:24:11.810
but nothing's going as planned.

00:24:11.810 --> 00:24:12.970
I-I'm sorry...

00:24:12.970 --> 00:24:15.550
I have everything worked out in my head.

00:24:15.550 --> 00:24:20.620
That usually means you haven't 
written anything down!
